schway-screen 1
screen startup-credential-store
title Startup credential storage locked
description A reopened conversation that cannot read the secure store offers to retry credential access.
variant light-120
size 120x30
cursor 7 27 visible
== text
 ⚡ schway  /project

  ▌ You
  ▌ Explain the config loader


  It merges defaults, user and project settings.

  ▌ ! Error
  ▌ Credential storage unavailable · Unlock the secure store
  ▌ Ctrl+R retry credential access · F2 details · Esc keep editing














